<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">250 &ndash; 350</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">300</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">4</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">SS</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">90 &ndash; 200</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">150</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">5</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Amoni (N &ndash; NH4+)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">25 &ndash; 50</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">40</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">6</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Nitrat (N &ndash; NO3&ndash;)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">0 &ndash; 0.5</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">0.2</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>QCVN nước thải y tế</strong></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Trong nội dung <strong>quy chuẩn nước thải bệnh viện</strong> của Nh&agrave; nước, QCVN - Quy chuẩn Việt Nam về nước thải y tế đ&atilde; được quy định r&otilde; r&agrave;ng tại nội dung số QCVN 28:2010/BTNMT do ch&iacute;nh Ban soạn thảo quy chuẩn kỹ thuật quốc gia về nước thải y tế trực tiếp bi&ecirc;n soạn. V&agrave; đ&atilde; được Tổng cục M&ocirc;i trường, Vụ Khoa học v&agrave; C&ocirc;ng nghệ c&ugrave;ng với Vụ Ph&aacute;p chế tr&igrave;nh duyệt v&agrave; ban h&agrave;nh theo Th&ocirc;ng tư số 39/2010/TT-BTNMT ng&agrave;y 16/12/2010 của Bộ trưởng Bộ T&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n v&agrave; M&ocirc;i trường cấp.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Các đơn vị y tế cần tuân thủ nghiêm ngặt Quy chuẩn Việt Nam về nước thải y tế\" src=\"/storage/uploads/thu/tieu-chuan-nuoc-thai-benh-vien1.png\" style=\"width: 604px; height: 337px;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><em>C&aacute;c đơn vị y tế cần tu&acirc;n thủ nghi&ecirc;m ngặt Quy chuẩn Việt Nam về nước thải y tế</em></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Theo đ&oacute;, QCVN quy định r&otilde; r&agrave;ng gi&aacute; trị tối đa cho ph&eacute;p của c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng số v&agrave; c&aacute;c loại chất g&acirc;y &ocirc; nhiễm trong nước thải y tế của c&aacute;c hệ thống bệnh viện, ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;m, cơ sở y tế n&oacute;i chung. V&agrave; đối tượng &aacute;p dụng của quy chuẩn n&agrave;y bao gồm c&aacute;c tổ chức, c&aacute; nh&acirc;n li&ecirc;n quan đến hoạt động thải nước thải y tế ra m&ocirc;i trường.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">C&ocirc;ng thức t&iacute;nh chất lượng nước thải y tế</span></span></span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">C&ocirc;ng thức t&iacute;nh chất lượng nước thải y tế đang được &aacute;p dụng hiện nay l&agrave;: Cmax = C x K</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Trong đ&oacute;:</span></span></span></em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">C: L&agrave; gi&aacute; trị của c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng số &ocirc; nhiễm trong nước thải được quy định trong bảng Gi&aacute; trị C của c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng số &ocirc; nhiễm dưới đ&acirc;y</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">K: L&agrave; hệ số về quy m&ocirc;, loại h&igrave;nh cơ sở y tế</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Trường hợp bệnh viện c&oacute; &ge; 300 giường th&igrave; K = 1,0</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">C&ograve;n nếu bệnh viện c&oacute; &lt; 300 giường th&igrave; K = 1,2</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">C&aacute;c cơ sở kh&aacute;m chữa bệnh kh&aacute;c th&igrave; c&oacute; K= 1,2</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"width:100%;\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">TT</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Th&ocirc;ng số</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Đơn vị</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td colspan=\"2\">\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Gi&aacute; trị C</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">A</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">B</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">1</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">pH</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">&ndash;</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">6,5 &ndash; 8,5</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">6,5 &ndash; 8,5</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">2</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">BOD 5 (20 o C)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">30</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">50</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">3</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">COD</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">50</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">100</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">4</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Tổng chất rắn lơ lửng (TSS)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">50</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">100</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">5</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Sunfua (t&iacute;nh theo H 2 S)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">1,0</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">4,0</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">6</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Amoni (t&iacute;nh theo N)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">5</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">10</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">7</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Nitrat (t&iacute;nh theo N)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">30</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">50</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">8</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Phosphat (t&iacute;nh theo P)</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">mg/l</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">6</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">10</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">9</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Dầu mỡ động thực vật</span></span></span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-a